{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20105","headline":"送韩愈从军 · 孟郊","name":"送韩愈从军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"志士感恩起，变衣非变性。\n亲宾改旧观，僮仆生新敬。\n坐作羣书吟，行爲孤剑咏。\n始知出处心，不失平生正。\n凄凄天地秋，凛凛军马令。\n驿尘时一飞，物色极四静。\n王师既不战，庙略在无竞。\n王粲有所依，元瑜初应命。\n一章喻檄明，百万心气定。\n今朝旌鼓前，笑别丈夫盛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}